1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,539
Slide a block across a rough floor.

2
00:00:02,539 --> 00:00:08,346
Friction turns its kinetic energy into heat, which spreads out into the floor.

3
00:00:08,346 --> 00:00:12,226
Push the block back, and friction heats the floor again.

4
00:00:12,226 --> 00:00:15,976
You can return the block, but never un-warm the floor.

